---
title: "Approach A — Notify then targeted refetch (RECOMMENDED)"
---
flowchart TD
  subgraph S["SERVER — single Bun process"]
    W["User write<br/>(advance deal / log interaction / create account)"]
    TICK["Decay/momentum tick (~hourly)<br/>recompute bands; on a crossing append<br/>ComputedBandChanged event<br/>(time-based change becomes a REAL event)"]
    A["EventStore.append()<br/>inside sql.withTransaction"]
    N["SELECT pg_notify('km_events', envelope)<br/>delivered to listeners on COMMIT"]
    HUB["Stream hub<br/>ONE app-wide LISTEN<br/>fan-out by orgId (isolation enforced here)"]
    RPC["getAccountHub / getOwed / getDemand<br/>existing SQL joins + decay decoration<br/>(SERVER READS UNCHANGED)"]
    AUTO["server-side automations (future)<br/>react to ComputedBandChanged"]
  end
  subgraph C["CLIENT — User A's browser"]
    SSE["SSE subscriber<br/>GET /api/stream (Last-Event-ID resumable)"]
    MAP["map envelope to affected collections<br/>coalesce/debounce ~120ms"]
    COL["TanStack DB query collections<br/>call .utils.refetch()"]
    LQ["useLiveQuery on pages"]
    UI["UI updates within ~1s"]
  end
  W --> A
  TICK --> A
  TICK -.-> AUTO
  A --> N --> HUB
  HUB -->|"TINY envelope:<br/>id, subjectKind, subjectId,<br/>eventType, conceptName"| SSE
  SSE --> MAP --> COL
  COL -->|"refetch over HTTP"| RPC
  RPC -->|"decorated rows back"| COL
  COL --> LQ --> UI
  TIMER["local timer (~60s)"] -->|"smooths decay 'days' countdown<br/>between ticks (display only)"| LQ
  classDef good fill:#16351f,stroke:#3fb96a,color:#d7f5e0;
  class RPC,TICK good;
